WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:05.660
All right. I got green. Hey.

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.130
Come to me.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.150
Where are you? You know where I am.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.730
How am I supposed to get there.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.650
The old Irish way.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.750
You're still Irish, aren't you?

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.060
I'm Irish. Enough, honey.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:54.500
That your office.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.600
Come off it being a crutch.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.340
But I'll sip whisky and stare at the stars

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:03.850
with you.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.860
Oh, thank you.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:19.000
I want you to take me out on a date.

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:22.120
A date, huh?

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:27.330
And eight. With dinner.

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:31.470
Maybe we can go to that music festival after

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:32.040
all.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.860
But I'm way too tired to analyze exactly what

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.510
it is that you want. But I know it ain't a

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:37.560
date. It's no test.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:46.270
Just a date. Lord knows you can afford it.

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:48.890
And we're in the same three pairs of jeans

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.660
and jacket for a f***ing decade.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:52.100
Yeah.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.650
Probably got more money than me.

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:55.100
No.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.380
Money's the one thing I don't have.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.510
You get paid every week, don't you?

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:02.960
Mm. So what do you spend your money on?

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:09.160
You're keeping a sweet little place in town

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.330
for a Saturday night.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.990
Jesus Christ. Why is it that your mind always

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:16.060
stops the first thing that you should never

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:16.330
do?

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:17.500
What's wrong with that?

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.200
I was a man. I'd buy an apartment complex

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.330
and I'd fill it with buxom little bunnies.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:24.880
I'd start on the first floor Friday and end

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.290
up on the roof by Sunday.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.370
I'm serious.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.300
What do you spend your money on?

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:38.780
Beth. It's a nice night.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:40.640
Let's not ruin it with truth.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:41.390
Tell me.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.740
I spent $22,000 on my mom's headstone.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.200
Stands about as tall as me.

00:02:55.670 --> 00:03:01.010
Marble. I got the guy to etch your face into

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:06.410
it. I spent 30.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.840
Am I my little brother's.

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.190
It stands a little bit taller.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:12.320
I don't know. I guess I want him to be a

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:16.320
little closer to heaven. At best, money that

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:19.470
I ever spent was 5,000 to a grave Digger and

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:20.070
Forsyth.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.570
What did you pay him for?

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.540
He dug out my father.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.190
Gave me his bones.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.810
I drove from there all the way to North

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.960
Dakota, throwing him out the f***ing window.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.440
I remember the stories of heaven and hell in

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:56.910
church. Lies a lot of it.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:00.890
I think heaven's right here.

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.210
So is Hell.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.330
One person can be walking the clouds right

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.700
next to someone enduring eternal damnation.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.380
And God is the land.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:29.130
Don't say it. It doesn't mean anything on

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:32.340
our roof. Under stars like a bunch of

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:33.420
f***ing hippies.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:40.940
Hey, tell me. Tell me when it saves me.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:43.810
Okay.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.200
I won't say it.

